  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The course. The city. The finish you earned—given dimension.</p>\n<p>Trace is personalized, framed 3D race-map artwork by Teklo Studio.</p>\n<h2>Pre-launch ordering status</h2>\n<p>Shopify ordering, intake receipt and proof delivery are still being verified. Trace is not ready for completed purchases. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact Teklo Studio</a> with questions before ordering.</p>\n<h2>Choose your finish and route accent</h2>\n<p>Choose Gallery or Nocturne. Route accents are Signal Orange, Volt Lime, Pulse Pink and Match My Medal Color. The currently configured medal-match option adds $25 USD to the standard variant price in either finish, before applicable discounts. Your selected variant price is shown above.</p>\n<h2>Personalization and route information</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Runner display name, race name, date, location and distance.</li>\n<li>Official finish time, or an explicit request to omit it; bib number is optional.</li>\n<li>A separate piece reference for each differently personalized item.</li>\n<li>Route input may be a GPX file, public activity link, official-course information or a course map for review.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Shopify intake and proof handoff must be verified before launch. A submitted route or intake is not production approval. Never provide fitness-account passwords or login credentials.</p>\n<h2>Product details being confirmed</h2>\n<p>Exterior frame, insert and raised-map measurements are being reconciled before launch. Production and shipping details, proof delivery, damage reporting and route-data handling are also being reviewed.</p>\n<h2>Returns and support</h2>\n<p>Trace is custom-made and is excluded from change-of-mind returns under the current <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">refund policy</a>. That policy separately covers damaged or defective items. Cancellation terms require confirmation before launch. This pre-launch update does not change the terms supplied with existing orders.</p>\n<h2>Gift notes</h2>\n<p>Add a gift note in the product form or cart before checkout.</p>",
